    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/extras/a9bbd5d96d52f5b00cb59bcc8d826d49.avif?t=1753695901\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Complete all challenges in the Battle Roots event to collect the powerful Tiger I!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 The rewards are calling! Claim the T-34-85, Strv 81, fantastic customizations, and resources in the Day One Protocol event!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Operation &quot;Long Range&quot;: Survive at all costs and grab prizes, including the Legendary camo for the AMX AC 48.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Check out the visually enhanced AMX AC 48, ISU-130, and T21.</p></p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll out, complete events, and expand your tank collection with the Tiger I, T-34-85, and Strv 81!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's World of Tanks Blitz, a legendary action-adventure tank game. Blitz is not about war, but tanks! Join this action-packed PvP shooter and explore unique vehicles and a variety of battlefields. Experience the adrenaline rush of intense tank battles that test your skills and strategy. <br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This FREE tank game keeps you engaged and brings everyday challenges and unique events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/extras/a69c8b69c1869c3b0cc8cb4883c7e643.avif?t=1753695901\" /></div>  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's World of Tanks Blitz, a legendary action-adventure tank game. Blitz is not about war, but tanks! Join this action-packed PvP shooter and explore unique vehicles and a variety of battlefields. Experience the adrenaline rush of intense tank battles that test your skills and strategy. <br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This FREE tank game keeps you engaged and brings everyday challenges and unique events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444200/extras/a69c8b69c1869c3b0cc8cb4883c7e643.avif?t=1753695901\" /></div>  </p>",
    "short_description": "Tanks, not war: jump into a free-to-play MMO action shooter with over 400 tanks. Enjoy stunning graphics and intuitive touch controls. Engage in 7vs7 battles, strategize with your team to conquer diverse maps. Customize tanks, unlock upgrades, and dive into adrenaline-pumping action on mobile and PC",
